WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.555 --> 00:00:01.930
DEBI CABRERA:
Today we're talking

00:00:01.930 --> 00:00:05.590
about Explainable AI, an
easier way to find products,

00:00:05.590 --> 00:00:08.950
and a biopharma
breakthrough powered by AI.

00:00:08.950 --> 00:00:12.250
I'm Debi Cabrera, and welcome
to "This Week in Cloud," where

00:00:12.250 --> 00:00:16.050
we serve you the
lowest-latency news.

00:00:16.050 --> 00:00:19.290
Explainable AI,
or XAI, helps you

00:00:19.290 --> 00:00:22.560
understand and interpret how
your machine learning models

00:00:22.560 --> 00:00:23.670
make decisions.

00:00:23.670 --> 00:00:27.690
We're excited to announce that
BigQuery Explainable AI is now

00:00:27.690 --> 00:00:29.250
generally available.

00:00:29.250 --> 00:00:31.140
BigQuery is the
data warehouse that

00:00:31.140 --> 00:00:34.650
supports Explainable AI in
the most comprehensive way

00:00:34.650 --> 00:00:38.880
with regards to both XAI
methodology and model types,

00:00:38.880 --> 00:00:41.580
all done at BigQuery
scale, enabling

00:00:41.580 --> 00:00:45.030
millions of explanations within
seconds with a single SQL

00:00:45.030 --> 00:00:46.350
query.

00:00:46.350 --> 00:00:49.080
We created a new
All Products Page

00:00:49.080 --> 00:00:52.290
to help you easily navigate
to your favorite Google Cloud

00:00:52.290 --> 00:00:53.040
products.

00:00:53.040 --> 00:00:56.760
This page showcases all of
the Google Cloud products,

00:00:56.760 --> 00:00:58.740
as well as our key
partner products

00:00:58.740 --> 00:01:01.200
in one easy-to-navigate place.

00:01:01.200 --> 00:01:03.510
With one click, you can
discover the product that

00:01:03.510 --> 00:01:05.850
is right for your solution.

00:01:05.850 --> 00:01:09.570
We're proud to announce another
deep integration between Google

00:01:09.570 --> 00:01:13.560
Cloud and Alphabet's AI research
organizations, the ability

00:01:13.560 --> 00:01:17.670
in Vertex AI to run DeepMind's
groundbreaking protein

00:01:17.670 --> 00:01:20.430
structure prediction
system, AlphaFold.

00:01:20.430 --> 00:01:23.820
This is exciting news
for us, but game-changing

00:01:23.820 --> 00:01:26.820
for data scientists and
organizations of all types

00:01:26.820 --> 00:01:30.480
in the biopharma space, from
those developing treatments

00:01:30.480 --> 00:01:34.620
for diseases to those creating
new synthetic biomaterials.

00:01:34.620 --> 00:01:37.260
If you want to read more
about these announcements

00:01:37.260 --> 00:01:40.030
or see a full list,
check out the link.

00:01:40.030 --> 00:01:41.520
Any thoughts or ideas?

00:01:41.520 --> 00:01:43.390
Leave us a comment or tweet us.

00:01:43.390 --> 00:01:46.130
We'll see you in the cloud.

